lass=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">阿拉伯文</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">← </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">继续</span><span class=\"mord\"> RTL</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>电话号码、日期、货币金额在 RTL 上下文中的正确显示需要注意：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>RTL 正确显示</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电话号码 <code>+1-234-567</code></td>\n<td>整体 LTR 隔离</td>\n<td>加号跑到右侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期 <code>2026/07/18</code></td>\n<td>整体 LTR 隔离</td>\n<td>分隔符方向错乱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围 <code>10-20</code></td>\n<td>整体 LTR 隔离</td>\n<td>连字符变减号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货币 <code>$100.00</code></td>\n<td>取决于 locale 约定</td>\n<td>符号和数字分离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 后端格式化数字时为 RTL locale 添加隔离&#10;function formatNumberForRtl(value: number, locale: string): string {&#10;  const formatted = new Intl.NumberFormat(locale).format(value);&#10;  if (isRtlLocale(locale)) {&#10;    return `\\u2066${formatted}\\u2069`; // LRI ... PDI&#10;  }&#10;  return formatted;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后端格式化数字时为 RTL locale 添加隔离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatNumberForRtl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> formatted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Intl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NumberFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(locale).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isRtlLocale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(locale)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2066</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">formatted</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u2069</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LRI ... PDI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatted;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"镜像与非镜像元素\">镜像与非镜像元素</h2><p>RTL 布局中，某些 UI 元素需要水平镜像，某些不需要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>元素示例</th>\n<th>是否镜像</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向性图标</td>\n<td>箭头、返回按钮</td>\n<td>镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布局</td>\n<td>导航栏、侧边栏</td>\n<td>镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图表坐标轴</td>\n<td>X 轴方向</td>\n<td>镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>品牌 logo</td>\n<td>商标图标</td>\n<td>不镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间线</td>\n<td>进度条</td>\n<td>看情况（文化差异）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>媒体控制</td>\n<td>播放/暂停按钮</td>\n<td>不镜像</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后端在生成包含图标引用的内容时（如邮件模板），需要根据 locale 方向选择正确的图标变体：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 邮件模板中的方向感知图标&#10;function getIconUrl(iconName: string, locale: string): string {&#10;  const dir = isRtlLocale(locale) ? &#39;rtl&#39; : &#39;ltr&#39;;&#10;  const mirrored = MIRRORED_ICONS.has(iconName);&#10;&#10;  if (mirrored &amp;&amp; dir === &#39;rtl&#39;) {&#10;    return `${CDN_BASE}/icons/${iconName}-rtl.svg`;&#10;  }&#10;  return `${CDN_BASE}/icons/${iconName}.svg`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 邮件模板中的方向感知图标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getIconUrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">iconName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isRtlLocale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(locale) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ltr'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mirrored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MIRRORED_ICONS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(iconName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (mirrored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rtl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CDN_BASE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/icons/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iconName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-rtl.svg`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CDN_BASE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}/icons/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">iconName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.svg`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"bidi-安全问题\">BiDi 安全问题</h2><p>Unicode 方向控制字符可被用于安全攻击（CVE-2021-42574, &quot;Trojan Source&quot;）：</p>\n<p>攻击者在源代码或用户输入中插入 RLO/LRO 控制字符，使代码的视觉显示与实际执行逻辑不同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"// 看起来像：access = &quot;user&quot; !== &quot;admin&quot;&#10;// 实际上因 RLO 字符：access = &quot;user&quot; !== &quot;nimda&quot; (reversed)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 看起来像：access = \"user\" !== \"admin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 实际上因 RLO 字符：access = \"user\" !== \"nimda\" (reversed)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>后端防御措施：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>输入验证</strong>：过滤/拒绝用户输入中的方向控制字符（U+202A-U+202E, U+2066-U+2069），除非业务明确需要</li>\n<li><strong>代码扫描</strong>：CI 中检测源文件里的 BiDi 控制字符</li>\n<li><strong>日志净化</strong>：记录含 RTL 文本的日志时，转义或移除方向控制字符</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 移除危险的方向控制字符（保留安全的 LRM/RLM）&#10;BIDI_CONTROL_CHARS = set(range(0x202A, 0x202F)) | set(range(0x2066, 0x206A))&#10;SAFE_MARKS = {0x200E, 0x200F}  # LRM, RLM&#10;&#10;def sanitize_bidi(text: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    return &quot;&quot;.join(&#10;        c for c in text&#10;        if ord(c) not in BIDI_CONTROL_CHARS or ord(c) in SAFE_MARKS&#10;    )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 移除危险的方向控制字符（保留安全的 LRM/RLM）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">BIDI_CONTROL_CHARS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">202A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">202F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2066</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">206A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SAFE_MARKS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200E</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># LRM, RLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sanitize_bidi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BIDI_CONTROL_CHARS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ord</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SAFE_MARKS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"后端-api-的-rtl-支持\">后端 API 的 RTL 支持</h2><p>对外 API 设计中的 RTL 考虑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>文本方向元数据</strong>：响应中对文本字段附带方向信息 <code>&quot;direction&quot;: &quot;rtl&quot;</code>，帮助客户端正确渲染</li>\n<li><strong>搜索结果高亮</strong>：在 RTL 文本中插入高亮标记（<code>&lt;mark&gt;</code>）时，标记不能破坏 BiDi 配对</li>\n<li><strong>文本截断</strong>：RTL 文本的省略号（<code>...</code>）应出现在左侧（文本末尾的视觉方向）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>RTL 支持的自动化测试应覆盖混合方向文本场景——这些测试用例与<a href=\"i18n-testing-automation\">国际化测试与自动化</a>中描述的伪本地化框架配合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>后端 RTL 支持的核心是正确使用方向隔离（Isolate）而非旧式嵌入（Embedding）。在模板变量插入时自动包裹 LRI/PDI 或 RLI/PDI 防止 RTL 上下文吸附 LTR 数据；HTML 邮件使用 <code>&lt;bdi&gt;</code> 和 <code>dir</code> 属性实现渲染引擎无关的方向控制。数字、电话号码、日期等 LTR 数据在 RTL 文本中需要整体隔离。安全层面，方向控制字符可被用于 Trojan Source 攻击，用户输入需过滤 BiDi override 字符。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTL 与双向文本支持","id":"rtl-与双向文本支持"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Unicode 双向算法（BiDi Algorithm）","id":"unicode-双向算法-bidi-algorithm"},{"level":2,"text":"后端输出中的 BiDi 问题","id":"后端输出中的-bidi-问题"},{"level":3,"text":"场景 1：模板变量插入","id":"场景-1-模板变量插入"},{"level":3,"text":"场景 2：邮件 HTML 生成","id":"场景-2-邮件-html-生成"},{"level":3,"text":"场景 3：日志与数据库中的 RTL 文本","id":"场景-3-日志与数据库中的-rtl-文本"},{"level":2,"text":"数字在 RTL 上下文中的行为","id":"数字在-rtl-上下文中的行为"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像与非镜像元素","id":"镜像与非镜像元素"},{"level":2,"text":"BiDi 安全问题","id":"bidi-安全问题"},{"level":2,"text":"后端 API 的 RTL 支持","id":"后端-api-的-rtl-支持"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"国际化测试与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-testing-automation"},"next":{"title":"国际化性能与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-performance-caching"}}